& TEAL vanilla & 10.97 & \textbf{42.32} & 66.06 & 38.61 & 7.88 \\ % exp_id: bench_teal30
& KL global (Ours) & 8.98 & 39.68 & \textbf{70.17} & 35.7$\pm$9.5 & \textbf{8.79} \\ % exp_id: kl30_3seed_global
